  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.anglerfish": "The Anglerfish, a deep sea predator known for its bioluminescent lure, which it uses to attract prey in the dark ocean depths.",
  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.barreleye": "The Barreleye, a deep-sea fish known for its transparent head and tubular eyes, which allow it to look upward to detect prey and predators above.",
  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.betta": "The Betta, also known as the Siamese fighting fish, is a colorful, territorial freshwater fish known for its vibrant fins and aggressive behavior towards other males.",
  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.blue_spotted_stingray": "The Blue-Spotted Stingray, a striking marine fish known for its vibrant blue spots and flattened body, often found gliding along sandy sea floors.",
  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.boxfish": "The Boxfish, a small, square-shaped fish with a rigid, box-like body, known for its ability to release toxins when stressed.",
  "profile.item.hybrid_aquatic.carp": "The Carp, a hardy, freshwater fish widely distributed and valued for its adaptability, playing a significant role in aquaculture and recreational fishing.",
